<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - InPhyNet cut from recommended list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - InPhyNet cut from recommended list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it pulled InPhyNet Medical Management Inc from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, InPhyNet agreed to be acquired by MedPartners Inc.</p>
<p>-- Furman Selz said its 12-month price target had been in the low $30s, but with the deal expected to close by late March/early April, the firm does not see enough upside to continue to recommend the stock.</p>
<p>-- InPhyNet lost 1/4 to 25-3/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
